      "text": "WHEREAS, Section 8(a) of the City Charter confers responsibility upon the Mayor for the \"effectiveness and integrity of city government operations\" and provides for the Mayor to \"establish and maintain such policies and procedures as are necessary and appropriate to accomplish this responsibility...\"; and",
