      "text": "WHEREAS, this Administration is dedicated to improving effectiveness, productivity and efficiency in government operations and to reducing the burdens placed on customers, e.g., residents, visitors, people doing business with New York City; and government employees, in an effort to produce better outcomes for people; and",
